{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026w4uly6yb2K1795173550.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港上月通脹按年升百分之2.2，政府展望整體通脹維持溫和。</p><p></p><p>剔除政府一次性紓困措施的影響，上個月基本通脹率是百分之2，較9月減少0.1個百分點。按分類升幅最高是，電力、燃氣及水，按年升一成二，雜項服務升百分之5，交通亦升百分之4.5。基本食品及煙酒，按年就下跌不足一個百分點。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CPI-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FFDQ4Wdu1r1795174216.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>政府發言人指，展望未來，整體通脹將維持溫和，但地緣政治緊張局勢，仍是短期內影響國際燃料價格的主要不確定因素，會密切留意相關發展。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:23:59.392948+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T19:57:33.839767+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T12:17:18.701108+00:00","content_hash":"3747a1f9efddd087354c8981dd0c5dd94dd56ca63eea111d45c455f7eaca5712","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:23:59.392948+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}